[Quotes]
victory1 = "Bow to me, I am a king you know."
victory2 = "Do you think you're the first person that ever felt like utterly destroying his enemy? It's an impulse as old as time itself"
victory3 = "Brazen power oft succumbs to silence and stealth!"
victory4 = "To kill a beast of prey, they must first hit him!"
victory5 = "Take your best shot. I will offer no resistance. Then it will be my turn."
victory6 = "If anyone deserves to exploit the vibranium resources here, it is this land's natives."
victory7 = "You underestimated me as a lesser creature. That was your first mistake."
victory8 = "Blood and death? Is this all I am to hear for the rest of my days?"
victory9 = "You should not hit a human in the side of the head with your fist. A human's head is harder."
victory10 = "Go, tell your leader that his chieftan has returned!"
victory11 = "Speak not to me of respect.. you've made a mockery of that word"
victory12 = "Better to die as men --- Than to live as slaves!"
victory13 = "May the spirits of our ancestors grant that we reach our destination in time!"
victory14 = "What happens when you disagree? When one of these earth-changing moments finds you all at odds with each other, Walk away now."
victory15 = "You have the blood of my people on your hands. So when this is done, When my wants have replaced my needs, I'm going to find you."
victory16 = "I take no pride in this, What we have done here today, The actions we have taken, I believe they will haunt us until the end of days."

